@startuml
title Smart Campus - Domain Class Diagram (revised)

enum BookingStatus {
  ACTIVE
  CANCELLED
}

class Student {
  - studentId : String
  - name : String
}

class Room {
  - roomId : String
  - name : String
  - capacity : int
  - blocked : boolean
  + block() : void
  + unblock() : void
}

class Booking {
  - bookingId : String
  - start : DateTime
  - end : DateTime
  - status : BookingStatus
  - confirmationId : String
  + overlaps(other : Booking) : boolean
  + cancel() : void
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : is reserved by

note right of Booking
  R2: active bookings for the same room must not overlap.
  Touching bookings (one ends when the next starts) do not overlap.
  R1: start in the future, 0 < (end - start) <= 2 hours.
  R4: confirmationId is set when a booking is created successfully.
end note
@enduml
